# Graphify Integration Skill

## Overview
This skill interfaces with Graphify to extract the complete AST and structural graph of the repository.

## Capabilities
- Generate code property graphs connecting files, modules, classes, and functions
- Produce raw structural artifacts: `graph.json`, `graph.html`, and `GRAPH_REPORT.md`
- Provide structural relationships: imports, calls, extends, implements, depends_on

## Instructions
1. Run Graphify structural analysis on repository root:
   ```bash
   npx graphify . --output .reponix/graph/source/
   ```
2. Check that `.reponix/graph/source/graph.json` has been populated.
3. Notify `spy-orchestrator` once structural extraction completes.
